			"strokeColor": "#f0883e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"text": "⚙️ Step 2: The Generation Loop (token by token)\n\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ INPUT: \"What is the sum of 40 and 2?\"                              │\n│ Tokenized: [892, 318, 262, 4771, 286, 16, 290, 17, 30]           │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\nITERATION 1: Starting at ROOT\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ current_node = ROOT                                                 │\n│ allowed_tokens = [12345, 555, 987]  ← Only these are valid!         │\n│                                                                     │\n│ Model Logits (Top 5):                                               │\n│   12345 (add)      : ████████████████████ 0.75  ⭐ SELECTED         \n│   555  (subtract)  : ████░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░ 0.10                     │\n│   987  (multiply)  : ███░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░ 0.08                     │\n│   444  (calculate) : ██░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░ 0.05                     │\n│   333  (format)    : █░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░ 0.02                     │\n│                                                                     │\n│ 🚫 All other 50,000+ tokens masked to -inf                        │\n│ ✅ selected: 12345 → \"add\"                                        │\n│ generated_tokens = [12345]                                         │\n│ current_node = Node_12345 (add)                                    │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\nITERATION 2: At Node \"add\"\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ current_node = Node_12345 (add)                                    │\n│ allowed_tokens = [456]  ← Only one choice!                         │\n│                                                                     │\n│ Model Logits (Top 1):                                              │\n│   456  (_)           : ████████████████████ 1.00  ⭐ SELECTED      │\n│                                                                     │\n│ ✅ selected: 456 → \"_\"                                            │\n│ generated_tokens = [12345, 456]                                    │\n│ current_node = Node_456 (_)                                        │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\nITERATION 3: At Node \"_\"\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ current_node = Node_456 (_)                                        │\n│ allowed_tokens = [789, 999, 111]  ← Three choices!                 │\n│                                                                     │\n│ Model Logits (Top 3):                                              │\n│   789  (numbers)    : ████████████████████ 0.85  ⭐ SELECTED        │\n│   999  (values)     : ████░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░ 0.10                    │\n│   111  (strings)    : ██░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░ 0.05                    │\n│                                                                     │\n│ ✅ selected: 789 → \"numbers\"                                      │\n│ generated_tokens = [12345, 456, 789]                               │\n│ current_node = Node_789 (numbers)                                  │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\n✅ TERMINAL NODE REACHED! current_node.terminal = True → STOP\n\n📦 Final Result: [12345, 456, 789] → \"add_numbers\"",
