		{
			"type": "text",
			"version": 94,
			"x": 44.99999997244742,
			"y": 1638.208540170551,
			"width": 750.75830078125,
			"height": 262.5,
			"strokeColor": "#7ee787",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"text": "📊 Step 4: Multiple Scenarios (Same Trie, Different Prompts)\n\n┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ SCENARIO 1: Addition        │ SCENARIO 2: Formatting    │ SCENARIO 3: Multiplication │\n├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ \"What is the sum of        │ \"Format this text with    │ \"Calculate the product of  │\n│  40 and 2?\"                 │  proper capitalization\"    │  5 and 7\"                  │\n│                              │                           │                            │\n│ Model picks:                 │ Model picks:               │ Model picks:               │\n│   12345 (add)   0.75 ⭐     │   333 (format)  0.85 ⭐   │   987 (multiply) 0.80 ⭐  │\n│   444 (calculate) 0.20      │   12345 (add)   0.05      │   12345 (add)    0.10     │\n│   555 (subtract) 0.03       │   444 (calculate) 0.05    │   444 (calculate) 0.05     │\n│   987 (multiply) 0.01       │   555 (subtract) 0.03     │   555 (subtract) 0.04      │\n│                              │                           │                            │\n│ Path: add → _ → numbers    │ Path: format → _ → string │ Path: multiply → _ → numbers│\n│                              │                           │                            │\n│ Result: \"add_numbers\" ✅   │ Result: \"format_string\" ✅│ Result: \"multiply_numbers\"✅│\n└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\n🔑 Key Insight: The trie provides the structure (valid options), the model provides the intelligence (choosing based on context)\n✅ Together they guarantee 100% valid function names!",
			"fontSize": 10,
			"fontFamily": 3,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"id": "ePVHV22z",
			"roughness": 0,
			"opacity": 100,
			"elementType": "text",
			"containerId": "box_scenarios",
			"originalText": "📊 Step 4: Multiple Scenarios (Same Trie, Different Prompts)\n\n┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ SCENARIO 1: Addition        │ SCENARIO 2: Formatting    │ SCENARIO 3: Multiplication │\n├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ \"What is the sum of        │ \"Format this text with    │ \"Calculate the product of  │\n│  40 and 2?\"                 │  proper capitalization\"    │  5 and 7\"                  │\n│                              │                           │                            │\n│ Model picks:                 │ Model picks:               │ Model picks:               │\n│   12345 (add)   0.75 ⭐     │   333 (format)  0.85 ⭐   │   987 (multiply) 0.80 ⭐  │\n│   444 (calculate) 0.20      │   12345 (add)   0.05      │   12345 (add)    0.10     │\n│   555 (subtract) 0.03       │   444 (calculate) 0.05    │   444 (calculate) 0.05     │\n│   987 (multiply) 0.01       │   555 (subtract) 0.03     │   555 (subtract) 0.04      │\n│                              │                           │                            │\n│ Path: add → _ → numbers    │ Path: format → _ → string │ Path: multiply → _ → numbers│\n│                              │                           │                            │\n│ Result: \"add_numbers\" ✅   │ Result: \"format_string\" ✅│ Result: \"multiply_numbers\"✅│\n└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\n🔑 Key Insight: The trie provides the structure (valid options), the model provides the intelligence (choosing based on context)\n✅ Together they guarantee 100% valid function names!",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"versionNonce": 849549788,
